block.mod:
Clause 51, page 36, line 8, at end insert—

          (ba)


enabling a patient, following diagnosis of a health condition, to consent to the sharing of such information as is necessary for the purpose of enabling the organisation to offer or provide condition-specific support to the patient with an approved voluntary, community or charitable organisation providing condition-specific support services;



          (bb)


facilitating referral, where consent has been provided, to such an organisation under subsection (ba);

Clause 79, page 54, line 19, at end insert—

          (ea)


section 61 (sections 56 to 60: interpretation);
